    factualSummary: "Trump created a White House Faith Office and a cabinet-level task force to eradicate what his order calls anti-Christian weaponization of government. In May 2026, top administration officials and Speaker Mike Johnson joined a government-linked America 250 prayer event framed as a national ‘rededication’ to God. The public programs present conservative Christian identity as central to national restoration while invoking protection for religious freedom.",
