    limitingContext: "Defendants waived appeal from this judgment. It expressly permits future lawful decisions about ceremonies and registration services and limits the findings' preclusive effect in litigation over new decisions. This is not immunity from all future regulation or a guarantee of participation at every event. No registration totals, discriminatory-motive conclusion, or historical-comparison score is added here.",
